# Default owner for everything.
*                       @zoza1982

# Guardrails. These files define the deterministic constraints (lints, bans, layering, supply
# chain), the verification models and the CI that enforces them. Weakening any of them weakens
# every future change, so each change here requires explicit owner review — even when the rest
# of a PR is routine. They name the same owner as `*` today and stay explicit so that adding
# maintainers to `*` never loosens review of the guardrails.
